source_models: a current source into a resistor (v(1) = 2m * 1k = 2 V) in a deck that declares builtin source models no element uses, as VACASK's test/test_inductor.sim does
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model isource isource
model spare isource
model resistor sp_resistor
i1 (0 1) isource dc=2m
r1 (1 0) resistor r=1k
control
  analysis op1 op
endc
